# TESS Research Lab (TRL)

> Autonomous Quantitative Strategy Research Engine for T_BOT

TESS Research Lab (TRL) is a self-contained research environment designed to continuously discover, optimize, validate, and rank algorithmic trading strategies without interfering with the live T_BOT trading system.

TRL serves as the research and development division of T_BOT.

Instead of manually tweaking indicators and parameters, TRL automatically explores thousands of strategy combinations using historical market data, parameter optimization, and AI-assisted strategy generation.

The objective is to continuously discover robust trading strategies that demonstrate strong performance across multiple market conditions before they are manually promoted into the live trading engine.

---

## Core Features

- Continuous multi-day strategy research
- Automatic historical market data downloading
- Strategy parameter optimization
- AI-assisted strategy generation
- Walk-forward validation
- Monte Carlo robustness testing
- SQLite experiment database
- Strategy leaderboard
- Beautiful terminal dashboard
- Export top-performing strategies into T_BOT

---

## Research Pipeline

Market Data

↓

Generate Candidate Strategies

↓

Backtest

↓

Optimize Parameters

↓

Validate

↓

Rank

↓

Store Results

↓

Export Best Strategies

---

TRL never executes live trades.

It is strictly a research environment.
